Compute Engine (VMs) // Works only with Billing 
1. List VM instances
 gcloud compute instances list 
2. Create a VM
 gcloud compute instances create my-vm \ --zone=us-central1-a 
3. Delete a VM 
gcloud compute instances delete my-vm \ --zone=us-central1-a 


